<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Arms Warrior</span></h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="the-celestial-court">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_pet_tigergodcub.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> The Celestial Court</span></h3>Chi-ji, Yu'Lon, Xuen, and Niuzao all share a loot pool and drop our item level 553 Tier 16 pieces. <br/>
<br/>Generally, your Pre-BIS or BIS list in Phase 5 shouldn't include 4 pieces of the Celestial tier 16 set, as the trade-off between 4 pieces of tier 16 and the loss of stats is not a worthy trade. <br/>
<br/>However, this advice should not be followed if you get the 553-item-level tier from this World Boss. Any 553 item-level Strength Item will be stronger than a 522 Celestial item equivalent. It's a bonus that the item you are getting builds towards your tier bonus, even though the tier bonuses are not that great.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="ordos">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_axe_1h_firelandsraid_d_02.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Ordos, Fire God of the Yaungol</span></h3>Ordos, Fire-God of the Yaungol, some great 559 item-level pieces, all of which are going to be much greater than any 522 item-level Celestial alternative.<br/>
<br/>The relevant items this World Boss drops for Arms Warrior are: <br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105807/magdalenas-murderous-crown">
<img alt="Magdalena's Murderous Crown" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_plate_raiddeathknight_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Magdalena's Murderous Crown</span></a>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105796/rossis-rosin-soaked-shoulderplates">
<img alt="Rossi's Rosin-Soaked Shoulderplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_raidwarrior_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rossi's Rosin-Soaked Shoulderplates</span></a>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105767/hoodrychs-bloodied-chestplate">
<img alt="Hoodrych's Bloodied Chestplate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidwarrior_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hoodrych's Bloodied Chestplate</span></a>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105785/vanguards-burly-bracers">
<img alt="Vanguard's Burly Bracers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_raidwarrior_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vanguard's Burly Bracers</span></a>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105783/greatbelt-of-the-crendor">
<img alt="Greatbelt of the Crendor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raiddeathknight_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greatbelt of the Crendor</span></a>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105759/magmaplates-of-jian-wu-xi-feng">
<img alt="Magmaplates of Jian Wu Xi Feng" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raiddeathknight_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Magmaplates of Jian Wu Xi Feng</span></a>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105761/partiks-purified-legplates">
