<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105766/anafielles-spiked-choker">
<img alt="Anafielle's Spiked Choker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_key_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Anafielle's Spiked Choker</span></a>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops-2">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_staff_2h_pandarenmonk_c_01.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Timeless Isle Items for Arms Warrior</span></h2>The Timeless Isle in Phase 5 is another option for catching up on gear.  You will earn <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=777/timeless-coin">
<span>
<img alt="Timeless Coin" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/timelesscoin.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Timeless Coin</span></span></a> for almost all activities that you participate in. Generally, the items received from <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=777/timeless-coin">
<span>
<img alt="Timeless Coin" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/timelesscoin.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Timeless Coin</span></span></a> are worse than those from Celestials. But by upgrading a <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=104009/timeless-plate-armor-cache">
<img alt="Timeless Plate Armor Cache" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enggizmos_19.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Timeless Plate Armor Cache</span></a> with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=103982/burden-of-eternity">
<img alt="Burden of Eternity" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_monk_envelopingmist.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Burden of Eternity</span></a>, you receive a 535 item-level piece, instead of a 489 item-level piece. Do note that this is very time-consuming. <br/>
<br/>Here's a list of notable items purchasable for Arms Warrior:<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=104009/timeless-plate-armor-cache">
<img alt="Timeless Plate Armor Cache" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enggizmos_19.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Timeless Plate Armor Cache</span></a> - 7500 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=777/timeless-coin">
<span>
