<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="crafted-gear">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_chest_cloth_challengepriest_d_01.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Pre-Raid Crafted Gear for Arms Warrior</span></h2>There are 2 new, great 553 item-level crafted items introduced in Phase 5 of Mist of Pandaria Classic. Both items are relevant when acquiring a pre-raid gear set. Do note that these items are rather expensive and are not <b>required</b> before entering a raid.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=98616/avengers-trillium-waistplate">
<img alt="Avenger's Trillium Waistplate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_93v3.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Avenger's Trillium Waistplate</span></a> is an amazing new blacksmithing item introduced in Phase 5, offering more optimal stats than the raid BIS belt <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105533/ashen-wall-girdle">
<img alt="Ashen Wall Girdle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raiddeathknight_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ashen Wall Girdle</span></a>. If you are clearing <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6738/siege-of-orgrimmar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Siege of Orgrimmar</span></a> on Normal, instead of Heroic, this crafted belt will be your raid BIS.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=98607/avengers-trillium-legplates">
<img alt="Avenger's Trillium Legplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_40v3.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Avenger's Trillium Legplates</span></a> is a fantastic new crafted piece introduced with Phase 5, offering perfect stats along with 2 red sockets.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=94267/haunted-steel-warboots">
<img alt="Haunted Steel Warboots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_deathknight_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Haunted Steel Warboots</span></a> is a decent 522 item-level option if you don't bother to farm extra <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=3416/august-stone-cluster">
<span>
<img alt="August Stone Cluster" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_legendarygem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">August Stone Cluster</span></span></a>.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=94266/haunted-steel-greathelm">
<img alt="Haunted Steel Greathelm" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_plate_raidwarrior_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Haunted Steel Greathelm</span></a> is another decent 522 item-level option if you don't bother to farm <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=3416/august-stone-cluster">
<span>
<img alt="August Stone Cluster" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_legendarygem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">August Stone Cluster</span></span></a>.</div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="gemming">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c1" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_uncut_purple.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Gemming for Arms Warriors</span></h2>Arms Warrior gemming in Mist of Pandaria Pre-BiS changes based on your item-level. Below 490 total item-level, you will want to prioritize gemming strength with <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76696/bold-primordial-ruby">
<img alt="Bold Primordial Ruby" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_cut_red.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bold Primordial Ruby</span></a>, but once you start reaching above 490 total item-level, you will want to swap over to gemming Critical Strike with <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76697/smooth-suns-radiance">
<img alt="Smooth Sun's Radiance" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_cut_yellow.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Smooth Sun's Radiance</span></a>. You may also gem <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76636/rigid-rivers-heart">
<img alt="Rigid River's Heart" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_cut_blue.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rigid River's Heart</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76693/precise-primordial-ruby">
<img alt="Precise Primordial Ruby" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_cut_red.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Precise Primordial Ruby</span></a> in their respective sockets if you are struggling to reach Hit and Expertise cap early on whilst gearing.<br/>
<br/>However, always consider socket bonuses when gemming. In scenarios when you want to reach socket bonuses, you gem yellow sockets with <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76661/inscribed-vermilion-onyx">
<img alt="Inscribed Vermilion Onyx" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_cut_orange.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Inscribed Vermilion Onyx</span></a>, and blue sockets with <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76684/etched-imperial-amethyst">
<img alt="Etched Imperial Amethyst" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_cut_purple.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Etched Imperial Amethyst</span></a> or <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76641/piercing-wild-jade">
<img alt="Piercing Wild Jade" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_cut_green.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Piercing Wild Jade</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>With Phase 3, there is now also the addition of <a class="q5 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95346/capacitive-primal-diamond">
<img alt="Capacitive Primal Diamond" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_legendary_chimeraoffear.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Capacitive Primal Diamond</span></a>.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
